ecord runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 years, the most of any pair. In 2025, June to July hit 187% of normal on the middle, while January to February was 34%. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, and grid 29835 fell to 39% that year.</p>"}
